or:rgb(92,11,214);overflow:hidden;\"><span leaf=\"\"><br></span></section><p style=\"margin-bottom:24px;outline:0;font-size:12px;letter-spacing:1.5px;color:rgb(111,19,209);transform:scale(.9);\"><span leaf=\"\">NEWS BRIEF</span></p></section></section></section></section><section id=\"yaodian\" style=\"margin:20px 10px;\"><section style=\"display:flex;margin-bottom:16px;align-items:baseline;\"><section style=\"flex-shrink:0;width:36px;text-align:left;\"><span style=\"font-size:24px;font-weight:900;color:rgb(92,11,214);font-family:Arial,sans-serif;font-style:italic;line-height:1;\">01</span></section><section style=\"flex-grow:1;\"><span style=\"font-size:16px;font-weight:700;color:#1f1f1f;letter-spacing:.5px;line-height:1.6;text-align:justify;font-family:-apple-system,BlinkMacSystemFont,'Helvetica Neue','PingFang SC','Microsoft YaHei',sans-serif;\">软银宣布7月在美国成立合资公司SB Neo，布局新云服务竞逐AI算力市场</span></section></section><section style=\"display:flex;margin-bottom:16px;align-items:baseline;\"><section style=\"flex-shrink:0;width:36px;text-align:left;\"><span style=\"font-size:24px;font-weight:900;color:rgb(92,11,214);font-family:Arial,sans-serif;font-style:italic;line-height:1;\">02</span></section><section style=\"flex-grow:1;\"><span style=\"font-size:16px;font-weight:700;color:#1f1f1f;letter-spacing:.5px;line-height:1.6;text-align:justify;font-family:-apple-system,BlinkMacSystemFont,'Helvetica Neue','PingFang SC','Microsoft YaHei',sans-serif;\">美团限制调用豆包大模型，全面推行自研 LongCat 体系并开源 2.0 版本</span></section></section><section style=\"display:flex;margin-bottom:16px;align-items:baseline;\"><section style=\"flex-shrink:0;width:36px;text-align:left;\"><span style=\"font-size:24px;font-weight:900;color:rgb(92,11,214);font-family:Arial,sans-serif;font-style:italic;line-height:1;\">03</span></section><section style=\"flex-grow:1;\"><span style=\"font-size:16px;font-weight:700;color:#1f1f1f;letter-spacing:.5px;line-height:1.6;text-align:justify;font-family:-apple-system,BlinkMacSystemFont,'Helvetica Neue','PingFang SC','Microsoft YaHei',sans-serif;\">快手旗下可灵AI传即将完成首轮独立融资，估值达180亿美元</span></section></section><section style=\"display:flex;margin-bottom:16px;align-items:baseline;\"><section style=\"flex-shrink:0;width:36px;text-align:left;\"><span style=\"font-size:24px;font-weight:900;color:rgb(92,11,214);font-family:Arial,sans-serif;font-style:italic;line-height:1;\">04</span></section><section style=\"flex-grow:1;\"><span style=\"font-size:16px;font-weight:700;color:#1f1f1f;letter-spacing:.5px;line-height:1.6;text-align:justify;font-family:-apple-system,BlinkMacSystemFont,'Helvetica Neue','PingFang SC','Microsoft YaHei',sans-serif;\">xAI 发布 Voice Agent Builder 测试版，支持两分钟构建生产级语音智能体</span></section></section><section style=\"display:flex;margin-bottom:16px;align-items:baseline;\"><section style=\"flex-shrink:0;width:36px;text-align:left;\"><span style=\"font-size:24px;font-weight:900;color:rgb(92,11,214);font-family:Arial,sans-serif;font-style:italic;line-height:1;\">05</span></section><section style=\"flex-grow:1;\"><span style=\"font-size:16px;font-weight:700;color:#1f1f1f;letter-spacing:.5px;line-height:1.6;text-align:justify;font-family:-apple-system,BlinkMacSystemFont,'Helvetica Neue','PingFang SC','Microsoft YaHei',sans-serif;\">Meta内部禁止工程师使用Claude Code与Codex，严防AI模型蒸馏风险</span></section></section></section><section style=\"margin:10px auto;text-align:center;\"><section style=\"display:inline-block;\"><section style=\"margin-top:-4px;padding:0 40px;outline:0;font-size:24px;letter-spacing:1.5px;\"><strong><span leaf=\"\">新闻速览</span></strong></section><section style=\"margin-top:-2px;width:182px;height:2px;background-color:rgb(58,19,228);overflow:hidden;\"><span leaf=\"\"><br></span></section><section style=\"margin-top:3px;width:182px;height:1px;background-color:rgb(111,19,209);overflow:hidden;\"><span leaf=\"\"><br></span></section><section style=\"outline:0;font-size:12px;letter-spacing:1.5px;color:rgb(92,11,214);transform:scale(.9);\"><span leaf=\"\">NEWS GLANCE</span></section></section></section><section id=\"xiangqing\"><section id=\"content1\"><section data-mpa-template=\"t\" mpa-from-tpl=\"t\" style=\"margin:40px 0 32px;outline:0;color:rgb(22,1,110);font-family:'PingFang SC';letter-spacing:.5px;font-size:16px;\"><section powered-by=\"xiumi.us\" mpa-from-tpl=\"t\" style=\"margin:10px 0 20px;outline:0;text-align:left;display:flex;flex-flow:row nowrap;\"><section mpa-from-tpl=\"t\" style=\"padding-left:5px;outline:0;display:inline-block;width:auto;vertical-align:top;border-left:5px solid rgb(45,5,147);flex:100 100 0%;align-self:flex-start;\"><section powered-by=\"xiumi.us\" mpa-from-tpl=\"t\" style=\"margin:-2px 0 -3px;outline:0;\"><section mpa-from-tpl=\"t\" style=\"outline:0;font-size:17px;line-height:1.3;text-align:justify;\"><p style=\"outline:0;\"><strong mpa-from-tpl=\"t\" mpa-is-content=\"t\" style=\"text-align:left;outline:0;\"><span leaf=\"\">软银宣布7月在美国成立合资公司SB Neo，布局新云服务竞逐AI算力市场</span></strong></p></section></section></section></section><section style=\"margin:16px 0;text-align:center;\"><img class=\"rich_pages wxw-img\" style=\"max-width:100%;border-radius:8px;\" src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/duguBoss/daily-tech-hub/main/assets/news_images/6125686a72adff615a40c0379ea677c4.jpg\"></section><section style=\"color:#333;line-height:1.8;font-size:15px;text-align:justify;\">软银集团与软银公司于2026年7月2日宣布，将于本月在美国成立合资公司SB Neo Inc.（暂定名），正式进军美国AI算力市场。该合资公司由软银公司持股51%，软银集团持股49%。SB Neo将依托软银集团正在推进的10吉瓦级能源与AI基础设施，计划在2027财年内推出名为“新云”（neocloud）的云服务，旨在为美国大型企业提供大规模AI模型训练与推理所需的高性能计算资源。面对美国市场持续增长的算力缺口，SB Neo制定了分阶段扩大服务能力的战略，并计划后续进一步部署10吉瓦规模的AI基础设施。此次布局被视为软银提升核心竞争力的关键举措，预计将推动软银公司年营业利润实现3至4倍的爆发式增长，目标达到3万亿至4万亿日元，折合约185亿至250亿美元。</section></section><section data-mpa-template=\"t\" mpa-from-tpl=\"t\" style=\"margin:40px 0 32px;outline:0;color:rgb(22,1,110);font-family:'PingFang SC';letter-spacing:.5px;font-size:16px;\"><section powered-by=\"xiumi.us\" mpa-from-tpl=\"t\" style=\"margin:10px 0 20px;outline:0;text-align:left;display:flex;flex-flow:row nowrap;\"><section mpa-from-tpl=\"t\" style=\"padding-left:5px;outline:0;display:inline-block;width:auto;vertical-align:top;border-left:5px solid rgb(45,5,147);flex:100 100 0%;align-self:flex-start;\"><section powered-by=\"xiumi.us\" mpa-from-tpl=\"t\" style=\"margin:-2px 0 -3px;outline:0;\"><section mpa-from-tpl=\"t\" style=\"outline:0;font-size:17px;line-height:1.3;text-align:justify;\"><p style=\"outline:0;\"><strong mpa-from-tpl=\"t\" mpa-is-content=\"t\" style=\"text-align:left;outline:0;\"><span leaf=\"\">美团限制调用豆包大模型，全面推行自研 LongCat 体系并开源 2.0 版本</span></strong></p></section></section></section></section><section style=\"margin:16px 0;text-align:center;\"><img class=\"rich_pages wxw-img\" style=\"max-width:100%;border-radius:8px;\" src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/duguBoss/daily-tech-hub/main/assets/news_images/a32dfb79f40f3ed73e377d63b42b5bce.jpg\"></section><section style=\"color:#333;line-height:1.8;font-size:15px;text-align:justify;\">美团近日下发内部通知，对豆包大模型的使用权限实施严格限制，要求各业务团队自查并对外部模型调用执行审批流程。此前，美团已于4月收紧对阿里云 Qwen 模型的调用权限。此次调整标志着美团进一步向自研技术栈倾斜。核心底座 LongCat 大模型已迭代至 2.0 版本，该模型具备万亿参数规模，支持 1M 超长上下文，并已在国产算力集群上完成全流程训练。美团同步开源 LongCat-2.0，并推出 LongCat-AudioDiT 音频生成模型及多模态模型 LongCat-Next，构建起覆盖视觉、语音与文本的全方位 AI 能力矩阵。目前，LongCat 体系已深度集成于“小团”AI 助手及商家经营工具中。此举旨在通过打造技术闭环，增强业务灵活性与安全性，标志着美团在 AI 基础设施建设上进入“硬核练内功”的新阶段。</section></section><section data-mpa-template=\"t\" mpa-from-tpl=\"t\" style=\"margin:40px 0 32px;outline:0;color:rgb(22,1,110);font-family:'PingFang SC';letter-spacing:.5px;font-size:16px;\"><section powered-by=\"xiumi.us\" mpa-from-tpl=\"t\" style=\"margin:10px 0 20px;outline:0;text-align:left;display:flex;flex-flow:row nowrap;\"><section mpa-from-tpl=\"t\" style=\"padding-left:5px;outline:0;display:inline-block;width:auto;vertical-align:top;border-left:5px solid rgb(45,5,147);flex:100 100 0%;align-self:flex-start;\"><section powered-by=\"xiumi.us\" mpa-from-tpl=\"t\" style=\"margin:-2px 0 -3px;outline:0;\"><section mpa-from-tpl=\"t\" style=\"outline:0;font-size:17px;line-height:1.3;text-align:justify;\"><p style=\"outline:0;\"><strong mpa-from-tpl=\"t\" mpa-is-content=\"t\" style=\"text-align:left;outline:0;\"><span leaf=\"\">快手旗下可灵AI传即将完成首轮独立融资，估值达180亿美元</span></strong></p></section></section></section></section><section style=\"margin:16px 0;text-align:center;\"><img class=\"rich_pages wxw-img\" style=\"max-width:100%;border-radius:8px;\" src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/duguBoss/daily-tech-hub/main/assets/news_images/0f4300690cd50684397f89db68d9d269.jpg\"></section><section style=\"color:#333;line-height:1.8;font-size:15px;text-align:justify;\">7月2日，市场消息显示快手旗下AI视频生成平台“可灵AI”即将完成首轮独立融资，融资规模预计达30亿美元，整体估值指向180亿美元。自2026年5月传出分拆融资计划以来，可灵AI的估值预期在150亿至200亿美元之间频繁波动。目前快手官方尚未对融资细节予以置评。行业分析认为，估值的持续更迭反映了一级市场对AI投资逻辑的转变，投资方正从单纯的技术溢价转向关注交易估值的合理性。在当前AI视频生成领域，可灵AI正面临字节跳动旗下Seedance等强劲对手的激烈竞争。此次融资若能顺利落地，将直接影响其后续的市场地位、商业化路径以及技术壁垒的构建，是决定其在长跑竞争中格局的关键节点。</section></section><section data-mpa-template=\"t\" mpa-from-tpl=\"t\" style=\"margin:40px 0 32px;outline:0;color:rgb(22,1,110);font-family:'PingFang SC';letter-spacing:.5px;font-size:16px;\"><section powered-by=\"xiumi.us\" mpa-from-tpl=\"t\" style=\"margin:10px 0 20px;outline:0;text-align:left;display:flex;flex-flow:row nowrap;\"><section mpa-from-tpl=\"t\" style=\"padding-left:5px;outline:0;display:inline-block;width:auto;vertical-align:top;border-left:5px solid rgb(45,5,147);flex:100 100 0%;align-self:flex-start;\"><section powered-by=\"xiumi.us\" mpa-from-tpl=\"t\" style=\"margin:-2px 0 -3px;outline:0;\"><section mpa-from-tpl=\"t\" style=\"outline:0;font-size:17px;line-height:1.3;text-align:justify;\"><p style=\"outline:0;\"><strong mpa-from-tpl=\"t\" mpa-is-content=\"t\" style=\"text-align:left;outline:0;\"><span leaf=\"\">xAI 发布 Voice Agent Builder 测试版，支持两分钟构建生产级语音智能体</span></strong></p></section></section></section></section><section style=\"margin:16px 0;text-align:center;\"><img class=\"rich_pages wxw-img\" style=\"max-width:100%;border-radius:8px;\" src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/duguBoss/daily-tech-hub/main/assets/news_images/2772f6c808deb0ee7e56fb6db3c0cb82.jpg\"></section><section style=\"color:#333;line-height:1.8;font-size:15px;text-align:justify;\">xAI 正式发布 Voice Agent Builder 测试版，该零代码平台基于自研 Grok Voice 模型，旨在降低企业级语音智能体开发门槛。在 τ-voice Bench 评测中，核心模型 Grok Voice Think Fast 1.0 得分达 67.3%，优于 Gemini 3.1 Flash Live 与 GPT Realtime 1.5。该平台采用端到端架构，集成电话通信、知识库检索、MCP 服务器连接及 Guardrails 合规防护，支持用户通过自然语言描述目标并上传文档快速配置。开发者可调用 API 连接器实现预约、查询等闭环业务，平台内置 80 多种音色并支持两分钟音频样本克隆。商业化方面，平台不收使用费，仅按 API 计费，音频费用为 0.05 美元/分钟，电话服务加收 0.01</section></section><section data-mpa-template=\"t\" mpa-from-tpl=\"t\" style=\"margin:40px 0 32px;outline:0;color:rgb(22,1,110);font-family:'PingFang SC';letter-spacing:.5px;font-size:16px;\"><section powered-by=\"xiumi.us\" mpa-from-tpl=\"t\" style=\"margin:10px 0 20px;outline:0;text-align:left;display:flex;flex-flow:row nowrap;\"><section mpa-from-tpl=\"t\" style=\"padding-left:5px;outline:0;display:inline-block;width:auto;vertical-align:top;border-left:5px solid rgb(45,5,147);flex:100 100 0%;align-self:flex-start;\"><section powered-by=\"xiumi.us\" mpa-from-tpl=\"t\" style=\"margin:-2px 0 -3px;outline:0;\"><section mpa-from-tpl=\"t\" style=\"outline:0;font-size:17px;line-height:1.3;text-align:justify;\"><p style=\"outline:0;\"><strong mpa-from-tpl=\"t\" mpa-is-content=\"t\" style=\"text-align:left;outline:0;\"><span leaf=\"\">Meta内部禁止工程师使用Claude Code与Codex，严防AI模型蒸馏风险</span></strong></p></section></section></section></section><section style=\"margin:16px 0;text-align:center;\"><img class=\"rich_pages wxw-img\" style=\"max-width:100%;border-radius:8px;\" src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/duguBoss/daily-tech-hub/main/assets/news_images/389552366f83b75ea62f8fb7e39a333d.jpg\"></section><section style=\"color:#333;line-height:1.8;font-size:15px;text-align:justify;\">Meta公司近日下达内部禁令，明确要求Applied AI部门工程师停止使用Anthropic的Claude Code及OpenAI的Codex工具。此举旨在防范“模型蒸馏”带来的数据污染与技术泄漏风险，避免Meta内部训练素材库收录竞品生成的代码片段，从而规避违反服务条款导致的法律纠纷。2026年以来，大模型行业关于蒸馏的博弈持续升级，此前OpenAI、Anthropic等厂商已多次指控竞品存在违规蒸馏行为。Meta作为Llama系列开源生态的推动者，此次对内部开发流程的“严防死守”，反映出其在维持开源战略与构建核心数据护城河之间的深层焦虑。行业分析认为，随着监管机构将“反蒸馏”提升至国家安全层面，Meta此举或引发巨头跟进，重塑大模型市场竞争规则，未来具备“空气间隙”式本地部署或私有云方案的技术将迎来增长机</section></section></section></section><section style=\"text-align:center;\"><img data-src=\"https://mmbiz.qpic.cn/mmbiz_png/xm1dT1jCe8lWwznuFM0USlcQ4HAb5iapyGyBVUyRZOyLbF3SaPphbdlF7K9R7YLicicIjdeAPueYcKHJDZEiceeUFQ/640?wx_fmt=png\" class=\"rich_pages wxw-img\" data-ratio=\"0.4255555555555556\" data-type=\"png\" data-w=\"900\" src=\"https://mmbiz.qpic.cn/mmbiz_png/xm1dT1jCe8lWwznuFM0USlcQ4HAb5iapyGyBVUyRZOyLbF3SaPphbdlF7K9R7YLicicIjdeAPueYcKHJDZEiceeUFQ/640?wx_fmt=png\"></section>",
